{"seq":5,"slug":"level-and-compensation","title":"职级与薪酬体系","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/level-and-compensation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"career-level-system","title":"Pfizer 职级体系与晋升通道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/level-and-compensation/career-level-system","wordCount":1391,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"compensation-structure","title":"Pfizer 薪酬结构全解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/level-and-compensation/compensation-structure","wordCount":1471,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-evaluation","title":"Pfizer 绩效考核体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/level-and-compensation/performance-evaluation","wordCount":1672,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"workplace-survival-guide","title":"Pfizer 职场生存指南","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/pfizer/level-and-compensation/workplace-survival-guide","wordCount":1710,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 职级与薪酬体系 简介\n\n本章深入解析辉瑞的职级架构、薪酬结构、绩效考核机制以及在大型制药企业中的职场生存策略。对于考虑加入辉瑞或已在辉瑞工作的专业人士，这些信息帮助你理解组织的游戏规则，做出更明智的职业决策。\n\n**职级体系**介绍辉瑞的Band系统和三大职能序列（科学/商务/运营），解析IC与管理双通道的设计逻辑。\n\n**薪酬结构**全面分析基本薪资、GPP年度奖金、RSU/LTI长期激励和福利体系，提供各层级的市场参考数据。\n\n**绩效考核**解读辉瑞的目标设定、Calibration会议、评级分布以及科学贡献与商业影响的平衡机制。\n\n**职场生存指南**直面大企业政治、裁员常态化、监管文化等现实挑战，提供务实的导航策略。\n"}